---
// Competitive Comparison Table Component
---

<section class="comparison-section" id="comparison">
  <div class="section-tag">
    <span class="tag-accent">//</span>
    <span>COMPETITIVE_ANALYSIS</span>
  </div>

  <div class="section-heading-group">
    <h2>Why Not ARC or Nektos/act?</h2>
    <p>RunZero eliminates enterprise K8s control plane bloat while running real production GitHub webhook queues on your local machine.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="table-wrapper">
    <table class="comparison-table">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Metric / Feature</th>
          <th class="col-highlight">⚡ RUNZERO</th>
          <th>🏢 ACTIONS RUNNER CONTROLLER (ARC)</th>
          <th>🎭 NEKTOS / ACT</th>
          <th>📦 STATIC DOCKERFILE</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td><strong>Target Machine</strong></td>
          <td class="col-highlight"><strong>Local Mac / Workstation</strong></td>
          <td>Enterprise Cloud K8s Fleet</td>
          <td>Local CLI Scratchpad</td>
          <td>Single Homelab Server</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><strong>Idle RAM Footprint</strong></td>
          <td class="col-highlight"><span class="check-yes">~20 MB</span> (0 MB at idle)</td>
          <td><span class="check-no">1.5 GB – 3.5 GB</span> (K8s Control Plane)</td>
          <td><span class="check-yes">0 MB</span> (Manual CLI only)</td>
          <td><span class="check-warn">~500 MB+</span> (Idle runner daemon)</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><strong>Execution Runtime</strong></td>
          <td class="col-highlight"><span class="check-yes">Dual-Engine (Docker + VM)</span></td>
          <td>Containers Only (K8s Pods)</td>
          <td>Containers Only</td>
          <td>Container Only</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><strong>Real GitHub Queue Listener</strong></td>
          <td class="col-highlight"><span class="check-yes">Yes</span> (Adaptive polling)</td>
          <td><span class="check-yes">Yes</span></td>
          <td><span class="check-no">No</span> (Local mock only)</td>
          <td><span class="check-yes">Yes</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><strong>Multi-Repo Discovery</strong></td>
          <td class="col-highlight"><span class="check-yes">Yes</span> (All user repos auto-scaled)</td>
          <td><span class="check-no">No</span> (Orgs only)</td>
          <td><span class="check-no">N/A</span></td>
          <td><span class="check-no">No</span> (1 repo per runner)</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><strong>Multi-Arch (Apple Silicon + Rosetta)</strong></td>
          <td class="col-highlight"><span class="check-yes">Yes</span> (Rosetta 2 acceleration)</td>
          <td><span class="check-warn">Complex</span> (Node taints/specs)</td>
          <td><span class="check-warn">Partial</span></td>
          <td><span class="check-no">No</span> (Fixed architecture)</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><strong>Local Caching Registries</strong></td>
          <td class="col-highlight"><span class="check-yes">Yes</span> (Verdaccio + Athens + Toolcache)</td>
          <td><span class="check-no">No</span> (Requires K8s PVCs/NFS)</td>
          <td><span class="check-no">No</span></td>
          <td><span class="check-no">No</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><strong>Setup Time</strong></td>
          <td class="col-highlight"><span class="check-yes">&lt; 60 Seconds (<code>make start</code>)</span></td>
          <td><span class="check-no">Heavy Helm / CRD setup</span></td>
          <td><span class="check-yes">1 Command</span></td>
          <td><span class="check-warn">Moderate</span></td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .comparison-section {
    padding: 72px 0 96px;
  }

  .section-tag {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--volt);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .tag-accent { color: var(--text-dim); }

  .section-heading-group {
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }
  .section-heading-group h2 {
    font-size: 2.4rem;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .section-heading-group p {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 1.08rem;
    max-width: 680px;
  }

  .table-wrapper {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    overflow-x: auto;
    box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
  }
  table.comparison-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    min-width: 680px;
    text-align: left;
  }
  table.comparison-table th, table.comparison-table td {
    padding: 16px 20px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  table.comparison-table th {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  }
  table.comparison-table th.col-highlight, table.comparison-table td.col-highlight {
    background: rgba(212, 255, 0, 0.04);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #fff;
  }
  table.comparison-table th.col-highlight {
    color: var(--volt);
    border-top: 2px solid var(--volt);
  }

  .check-yes { color: var(--volt); font-weight: bold; }
  .check-no { color: var(--rose); font-weight: bold; }
  .check-warn { color: var(--amber); }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    th, td { padding: 12px 14px; font-size: 0.82rem; }
  }
</style>
